# held/weapons/dagger: the straight dagger (art weapon 5, `held dagger.straight`): A3 sword in small: a 2 px blade of 5 (the lit line step 3, the back step 2, a white point), a 3 px guard and a pommel either side of the fist (P2c wave 2, WEAPONS). STYLE_P2 11 / 25.7; P2C_CONTRACTS 4: the library weapon on the grip,
# a000..a337 = degrees counter-clockwise from screen-right, drawn once (D) for every facing; origin = the grip point
# under the main fist (the hand is drawn over the grip); `mark tip` at the far end. Drafted with the area's stepper (exact
# 1:0, 2:1, 1:1 and 1:2 runs, the top-left light by rule: a 2 px band's upper / left line lit) and hand-cleaned at 12x.
# Finish regions (contracts 3b): R the guard and pommel, G the pommel, P the flat, N the fuller.
use person
body adult
role held dagger
role held dagger.straight
layer held
anchor grip
keys held
tags anyfacing
view D key a000 origin 2 1 anchor grip
mark tip 9 1
